{
  "notes": [
    "Flip gate for the wasm backend's component wrapping",
    "(src/wasm_backend/component.rs `encode`: wit-parser, wit-component and",
    "wasmparser validation), ported as @vesper/wit-component (SH5 lane 11,",
    "#1334) and installed as the hybrid's `component` hook. A compiler module:",
    "its Rust, and the wit-component and wit-parser dependencies of the",
    "compiler, are deleted by the Rust compiler's retirement (SH6 lane 2), not",
    "by this flip.",
    "Every component the Rust backend wraps over the cases (1,383), byte for",
    "byte; 0 declined.",
    "The module's own speed: every component from its core module and WIT.",
    "The compiler-module bar: the whole wasm build of every input",
    "(`wasm_backend::compile`) with the port as the `component` hook against",
    "without it."
  ],
  "name": "wit-component",
  "lane": "SH5-11",
  "rust": ["src/wasm_backend/component.rs"],
  "env": {
    "CARGO_PROFILE_DEV_DEBUG": "0",
    "CARGO_PROFILE_TEST_DEBUG": "0",
    "CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_DEBUG": "0",
    "WIT_COMPONENT_STEP": "1"
  },
  "build": [
    ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_wit_component", "--no-run"]
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "run": ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_wit_component"]
    }
  ],
  "differential": {
    "run": ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_wit_component", "port_matches_wit_component", "--", "--nocapture"]
  },
  "abba": [
    {
      "workload": "wrap",
      "run": {
        "argv": ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_wit_component", "flip_gate", "--", "--ignored", "--nocapture"],
        "env": {
          "WIT_COMPONENT_GATE_WORKLOAD": "wrap",
          "CHECK_HARNESS_SPEED": "1"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "workload": "build",
      "run": {
        "argv": ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_wit_component", "flip_gate", "--", "--ignored", "--nocapture"],
        "env": {
          "WIT_COMPONENT_GATE_WORKLOAD": "build",
          "CHECK_HARNESS_SPEED": "1"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
